<section class="privacy-section" aria-labelledby="information-title">
<h2 id="information-title">Information We Collect</h2>

<h3>Information You Provide</h3>

<p>
If you contact Carrie Gabaree through the website, by email, through LinkedIn,
or through another professional communication channel, information that you
voluntarily provide may be collected, including:
</p>

<ul>
<li>Name</li>
<li>Email address</li>
<li>Telephone number, if provided</li>
<li>Company, institution, museum, or organization, if provided</li>
<li>Professional role or affiliation, if provided</li>
<li>Subject of your inquiry</li>
<li>Any information included in your message</li>
</ul>

<p>
This information is used to respond to your inquiry, provide requested
information, and maintain appropriate professional correspondence.
</p>

<h3>Automatically Collected Information</h3>

<p>
Like most websites, certain technical information may be collected
automatically when you visit the site. This may include:
</p>

<ul>
<li>Internet Protocol address</li>
<li>Browser type and version</li>
<li>Device and operating-system information</li>
<li>Pages visited</li>
<li>Date and time of your visit</li>
<li>Time spent on pages</li>
<li>Referring website or source</li>
<li>Diagnostic, performance, and security information</li>
</ul>

<p>
This information may be used to maintain website security, understand how the
site is used, and improve performance and usability.
</p>

