<section class="privacy-section" aria-labelledby="cookies-title">
<h2 id="cookies-title">Cookies and Similar Technologies</h2>

<p>
Google Analytics loads only after you choose “Allow cookies.” It measures visits,
pages viewed, device types, and approximate location. Advertising personalization
and Google signals are disabled. Cloudflare Web Analytics provides separate,
cookie-free aggregate traffic and performance measurements.
</p>

<p>
You can decline, dismiss the notice without consenting, or change your choice
using “Privacy choices” in the footer. Your choice is stored for up to 180 days.
Withdrawal stops Google Analytics and removes its measurement cookies. A dismissed
notice stays hidden for the current tab session. If your browser cannot save your
choice, optional analytics remain off. The site works without optional cookies.
</p>
<p>The contact form uses a necessary, secure session cookie lasting up to one hour
to prevent forged or repeated submissions. Short-lived rate limits use a hashed
IP address; this is not used to identify visitors by name or physical address.
Cloudflare also processes network information to deliver and protect the site.</p>

<p class="privacy-return">
  <a href="#privacy-title">
    Return to table of contents
  </a>
</p>

</section>

<section class="privacy-section" aria-labelledby="use-title">
<h2 id="use-title">How Information Is Used</h2>

<p>Information collected through or in connection with this website may be used to:</p>

<ul>
<li>Respond to inquiries and requests</li>
<li>Provide requested information about publications, oral histories, or professional work</li>
<li>Maintain professional correspondence and appropriate records</li>
<li>Improve website content, performance, and usability</li>
<li>Monitor website security and prevent misuse</li>
<li>Comply with applicable legal obligations</li>
<li>Protect the rights and interests of Carrie Gabaree and others</li>
</ul>

<p><strong>Personal information is not sold to third parties.</strong></p>

