<section class="privacy-section" aria-labelledby="third-party-title">
<h2 id="third-party-title">Third-Party Services</h2>

<p>
This website may use or link to trusted third-party services that support
hosting, security, communications, document access, media delivery, and
professional networking. Depending on the features used, these may include:
</p>

<ul>
<li>Cloudflare website hosting, security, Web Analytics, and Stream video delivery</li>
<li>Google Analytics, only after your consent</li>
<li>LinkedIn</li>
<li>Resend for contact-form email delivery, and the recipient’s email provider</li>
<li>PDF, document, video, or media-hosting services</li>
</ul>

<p>
These providers may process limited information according to their own privacy
policies, terms, and security practices. Carrie Gabaree does not control the
privacy practices of third-party websites or services.
</p>
<p>Contact-form submissions are delivered to carrie@carriegabaree.com through
Resend with encrypted delivery required. The website does not store message
bodies in its form-security state or application logs. Email providers retain
messages and delivery records under their own policies. Embedded historical
videos are delivered by Cloudflare Stream and may process technical playback data.</p>

