<section class="privacy-section" aria-labelledby="oral-history-title">
<h2 id="oral-history-title">Oral Histories and Historical Materials</h2>

<p>
This website may present or link to oral histories, publications, photographs,
documents, citations, and other historical or professional materials. Rights,
credits, access restrictions, and permissions may vary by item and may be
identified on the relevant page or record.
</p>

<p>
Information about interview participants, historical subjects, creators,
repositories, and institutions may be included when appropriate for scholarly,
archival, descriptive, educational, or attribution purposes. Requests relating
to a specific item should identify the page, interview, publication, or record
in question.
</p>

